 "intro": "Ways of giving a reason: from an excuse in conversation to a formal notice.",
 "palabras": [
  {
   "palabra": "porque",
   "significado": "because",
   "pron": "por-KE",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "conjunction",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is written as one word with no accent when it gives the reason. It answers «¿por qué?».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "por qué",
   "significado": "why",
   "pron": "por KE",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "To ask, it is written as two words with an accent: «¿Por qué llegas tarde?».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "como",
   "significado": "as; since",
   "pron": "KO-mo",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "conjunction",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "With a causal meaning it usually comes first: «Como llovía, nos quedamos en casa».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "es que",
   "significado": "the thing is",
   "pron": "es ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It opens an explanation or an excuse in conversation: «Es que tengo trabajo».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "ya que",
   "significado": "since; given that",
   "pron": "ya ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It presents a reason that is already clear: «Ya que estás aquí, ayúdame».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "puesto que",
   "significado": "since (formal)",
   "pron": "PWES-to ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "Like «ya que», but more formal. It is used more in writing than in speech.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "debido a",
   "significado": "due to",
   "pron": "de-BI-do a",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It goes with a noun: «debido a la lluvia». With a clause add que: «debido a que llovía».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "gracias a",
   "significado": "thanks to",
   "pron": "GRA-thyas a",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It presents a positive cause: «gracias a ti llegué a tiempo».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
